  "body": "Spec at <https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#tables-2:the-tr-element> says:\r\n\r\n> The tr element's height attribute maps to the dimension property (ignoring zero) 'height' on the tr element.\r\n\r\nbut all of Gecko, WebKit, Blink allow 0.  Testcase:\r\n```\r\n<table style=\"display: block\">\r\n  <tr style=\"display: block; border: 1px solid green\" height=\"0\">\r\n    <td>Hey</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n```\r\nShould probably align with implementations here.",
